.TH QUIPU-EVENTS 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-events \- Read store event records such as refusals
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu events\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read store event records such as refusals
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-events\-refusals(1)
List recorded write refusals
.TP
quipu\-events\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
